      "description": "Watch Levante vs Real Betis highlights and goals from La Liga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 29, 2026. The atmosphere was charged with expectation as Levante hosted Real Betis in a high-stakes fixture that promised to challenge the tactical resolve of both sides. With the teams ready for kickoff on August 29, 2026, the stage was set for a display of pure footballing passion within the La Liga schedule. A Thrilling Opening Half The match ignited early when Adrian De La Fuente put Levante ahead in the 24th minute, nodding home a corner delivered by Jon Olasagasti . The lead was short-lived, however, as Marc Bartra leveled for Real Betis in the 34th minute, pouncing on a loose ball. The back-and-forth nature of the half reached a fever pitch just before the break, with Enzo Bardeli scoring a magnificent lob to restore the hosts' lead, only for Rodrigo Riquelme to equalize yet again with a header deep into stoppage time. Second Half Dominance After the interval, Levante seized control of the narrative. Roger Brugue restored the home lead in the 56th minute off an Enzo Bardeli assist, and he doubled his tally in the 70th minute after Ivan Romero had previously rattled the post. With the momentum firmly in their favor, the home side effectively neutralized the visitors' efforts to respond. The clinical nature of the attack culminated in the dying minutes as Jon Olasagasti slotted home the final goal, capping off a 5-2 victory that showcased the hosts' offensive brilliance."
